{"about_the_game":"Lunar Loot is a casual, big-numbers-go-up, incremental game. You'll kill the waves of enemies to gather Moonshards and spend those in the shop in between waves. In order to promote the incremental aspects of the game, there is absolutely no way to die. This opens open potential for <strong>so </strong> many strategies! Do you try to get one enemy type that drops a ton of Moonshards? Or do you buy a bunch of turrets to do all the killing for you? Or perhaps you buy some landmines. They are all viable strategies. The choice is yours!                                                                          <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853770/extras/Upgrade_Gif.gif?t=1726669726\" /><br><br> <br><strong>Key Features</strong><br>- Unique incremental survivor-like gameplay!<br><br>- Retro-y pixel art style!<br><br>- Many different upgrades and items!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853770/extras/Turret_Gif.gif?t=1726669726\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2853770?t=1726669726","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2853770?t=1726669726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726669726","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726669726","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Lunar Loot is a casual, big-numbers-go-up, incremental game. You'll kill the waves of enemies to gather Moonshards and spend those in the shop in between waves. In order to promote the incremental aspects of the game, there is absolutely no way to die. This opens open potential